WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The offering is active: enemies begin at 45 of 64 HP.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Cards alter damage and attack timing as elixir is spent.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Health and attack timers update as the remaining enemies take damage.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:46.100
Victory presents another reward. This run selects Uncertain Fates.

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:48.240
The updated deck returns to the map.
